    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {1}{2 j} \\left[ \\frac {1}{s - j \\omega_ {0}} - \\frac {1}{s + j \\omega_ {0}} \\right] = \\frac {1}{2 j} \\left[ \\frac {2 j \\omega_ {0}}{(s - j \\omega_ {0}) (s + j \\omega_ {0})} \\right] = \\frac {\\omega_ {0}}{s ^ {2} + \\omega_ {0} ^ {2}}\n$$",
