        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "8、S域积分性质：若 $f(t)\\leftrightarrow F(s)$ ，则 $\\frac{f(t)}{t}\\leftrightarrow \\int_s^\\infty F(\\eta)d\\eta$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            541,
            640,
            576
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "9、时域卷积定理：",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            695,
            312,
            711
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $f_{1}(t)\\leftrightarrow F_{1}(s),f_{2}(t)\\leftrightarrow F_{2}(s)$ ，则 $f_{1}(t)*f_{2}(t)\\leftrightarrow F_{1}(s)\\cdot F_{2}(s)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            725,
            737,
            745
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            753,
            173,
            772
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\xrightarrow {f (t)} \\boxed {\\text {系统}} \\xrightarrow {y (t)} y (t) = x (t) * h (t)   Y (s) = X (s) H (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            784,
            677,
            820
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "②有始周期信号",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            834,
            292,
            851
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t - n T _ {0}) \\overset {L T} {\\leftrightarrow} \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} e ^ {- n s T _ {s}} = \\frac {1}{1 - e ^ {- s T _ {s}}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            327,
            856,
            668,
            908
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
