        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "10、频域卷积定理",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            87,
            315,
            104
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {1} (t) \\cdot f _ {2} (t) \\longleftrightarrow \\frac {1}{2 \\pi j} F _ {1} (s) * F _ {2} (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            108,
            643,
            145
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "11、初值定理：设 $f(t) \\leftrightarrow F(s)$",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            170,
            421,
            187
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $F(s)$ 为真分式的情况下，则 $f(0_{+})=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}sF(s)$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            198,
            566,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $F(s)$ 为假分式的情况下，则长除法 $F(s)=$ 多项式 $+F_{0}(s)$ (真分式)",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            237,
            757,
            256
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (0 _ {+}) = f _ {0} (0 _ {+}) = \\lim _ {s \\to \\infty} s F _ {0} (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            368,
            268,
            626,
            292
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "说明：",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            300,
            203,
            317
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "用初值定理 $f(0_{+})=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}sF(s)$ 求函数的初值，如果 $F(s)$ 是有理代数式，则 $F(s)$ 必须是真分式，即 $F(s)$ 分子的最高次数应低于分母的最高次数。如果 $F(s)$ 不是真分式，则应利用长除法，使 $F(s)$ 中出现真分式项 $F_{0}(s)$ ，而初值 $f(0_{+})$ 等于真分式 $F_{0}(s)$ 之逆变换式 $f_{0}(t)$ 的初值 $f_{0}(0_{+})$ ，即",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            329,
            850,
            436
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (0 _ {+}) = f _ {0} (0 _ {+}) = \\lim _ {s \\to \\infty} s F _ {0} (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            368,
            445,
            626,
            470
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下面证明上式的正确性。",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            476,
            364,
            494
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设对于 $F(s)$ 长除后有",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            505,
            332,
            521
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF (s) = K _ {m} s ^ {m} + K _ {m - 1} s ^ {m - 1} + \\dots + K _ {0} + F _ {0} (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            302,
            533,
            694,
            551
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "式中， $F_{0}(s)$ 是真分式。对上式取逆变换",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            558,
            502,
            576
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) = K _ {m} \\delta^ {(m)} (t) + K _ {m - 1} \\delta^ {(m - 1)} (t) + \\dots + K _ {0} \\delta (t) + f _ {0} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            248,
            586,
            746,
            605
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "其中冲激函数及其各阶导数在 $t = 0_{+}$ 时刻全为零，于是",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            612,
            633,
            629
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (0 _ {+}) = f _ {0} (0 _ {+}) = \\lim _ {s \\to \\infty} s F _ {0} (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            368,
            640,
            626,
            665
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
