            344,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
        "bbox": [
            653,
            24,
            880,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            117,
            956,
            354,
            975
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
            954,
            880,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "12、终值定理：关于终值定理，应注意只有在 $f(t)$ 的终值存在的情况下，才能利用式",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            85,
            850,
            131
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\lim _ {t \\to \\infty} f (t) = \\lim _ {s \\to 0} s F (s)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            406,
            141,
            586,
            167
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】求 $f(t)$ 的终值。根据 $F(s)$ 的极点与时域的对应关系，如果 $\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}f(t)$ 是一确定的有限值(包括零)，则 $F(s)$ 的极点应全部落在左半s平面或在s=0处只有一阶极点。若 $F(s)$ 的极点不满足该条件，则终值 $\\lim_{t\\to\\infty}f(t)$ 不存在。",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            173,
            848,
            261
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例4：求 $F(s) = \\frac{3s}{(s + 3)(s + 2)}$ 的初值和终值。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            294,
            527,
            331
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 5：已知信号的拉氏变换函数如下，求原信号的初值与终值。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            392,
            702,
            410
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(1) F (s) = \\frac {s ^ {2} + 2 s + 1}{(s - 1) (s + 2) (s + 3)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            418,
            357,
            450
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(2) F (s) = \\frac {s ^ {3} + s ^ {2} + 2 s + 1}{(s + 1) (s + 2) (s + 3)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            456,
            357,
            488
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(3) F (s) = \\frac {1}{s (s + 1)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            493,
            290,
            521
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
